DELETE /wiki/api/v2/attachments/{attachment-id}/properties/{property-id}
Deletes a content property for an attachment by its id. **[Permissions](https://confluence.atlassian.com/x/_AozKw) required**: Permission to attachment the page.
Required: attachment-id (path) — The ID of the attachment the property belongs to.; property-id (path) — The ID of the property to be deleted.

GET /wiki/api/v2/attachments/{attachment-id}/properties/{property-id}
Retrieves a specific Content Property by ID that is attached to a specified attachment. **[Permissions](https://confluence.atlassian.com/x/_AozKw) required**: Permission to view the attachment.
Required: attachment-id (path) — The ID of the attachment for which content properties should be returned.; property-id (path) — The ID of the content property to be returned

GET /wiki/api/v2/attachments/{attachment-id}/versions/{version-number}
Retrieves version details for the specified attachment and version number. **[Permissions](https://confluence.atlassian.com/x/_AozKw) required**: Permission to view the attachment.
Required: attachment-id (path) — The ID of the attachment for which version details should be returned.; version-number (path) — The version number of the attachment to be returned.

PUT /wiki/api/v2/attachments/{attachment-id}/properties/{property-id}
Update a content property for attachment by its id. **[Permissions](https://confluence.atlassian.com/x/_AozKw) required**: Permission to edit the attachment.
Required: attachment-id (path) — The ID of the attachment the property belongs to.; property-id (path) — The ID of the property to be updated.; body (body) — The content property to be updated.
